<title>USA: Turner shareholders endorse acquisition.</title>
<headline>Turner shareholders endorse acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Turner Broadcasting Systems Inc on Thursday approved the acquisition of the entertainment and information company by Time Warner Inc.</p>
<p>The vote follows the deal's approval earlier Thursday by Time Warner shareholders and creates the biggest media corporation in the world.</p>
<p>The $6.7 billion deal, struck more than a year ago, will be formally closed at 1800 EDT/2200 GMT, executives said.</p>
<p>-- Michael Connor, 212-859-1713</p>
</text>
